hadiths[6]{hadithnumber,text}:
"23864","Yahya ibn Sa'id narrated to us, Sufyan narrated to us from Mansur from Mujahid from a man of Thaqif, and he is al-Hakam ibn Sufyan or Sufyan ibn al-Hakam, who said: I saw the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) urinate then sprinkle his private part."
"23865","Aswad ibn Amir narrated to us, Sharik narrated to us who said: I asked the family of al-Hakam ibn Sufyan, and they mentioned that he did not reach the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him)."
"23866","Abu Abdurrahman said: And Shu'bah and Wuhayb narrated it from Mansur from Mujahid from al-Hakam ibn Sufyan from his father that he saw the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him)."
"23867","And others than them said: From Mansur from Mujahid from al-Hakam ibn Sufyan who said: I saw the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him), and he mentioned it."
"23868","And Abdullah said: I found in my father's book in his handwriting: Ya'la ibn Ubayd narrated to us, Sufyan narrated to us from Mansur from Mujahid from al-Hakam ibn Sufyan or Sufyan ibn al-Hakam that the Prophet (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) urinated then sprinkled his private part."
"23869","He narrated to us."
